     * Pads the left side with zeros until the total length is 16 characters.
   * Example: 00000086726535.03.
 * Output Batching
   * Logic: Controls how many records appear on one line.
   * Rule: It combines 4 processed items (Head + Amount) into a single line before starting a new one.
 * File Header Construction
   * Logic: Creates the very first line of the file.
